Issues and standard of review [17] The Applicant raises the following issues in arguing the decision is unreasonable:
the persecution analysis is flawed;
adequate reasons to support the findings were not provided;
there was a failure to properly assess the documentary evidence; and
there was a failure to conduct a separate section 97 analysis.

